# Security model — deployed via `firebase deploy --only firestore:rules` from
# the LOCAL copy. Untracked because GitHub Pages serves every tracked file at
# the site root: goforge.in/firestore.rules returned 200, handing anyone a map
# of exactly what the rules do and do not allow. Removing it is PROSPECTIVE
# only — 15 revisions are already public and must be assumed known. Canonical
# copy + backups live in ~/Desktop/forge-backups/.
firestore.rules
